OL,3,GNEWSAPM pays tribute to 'political
OL,4,Agenius' Pat Karney at funeral
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has
OL,7,Fdescribed long-serving Manchester
OL,8,Fcouncillor Pat Karney as a "political
OL,9,Fgenius" at his funeral, saying his
OL,10,F"spirit is in every street" of the
OL,11,Fcity.
OL,13,FBurnham, who worked alongside the
OL,14,FLabour politician for 25 years, told
OL,15,Fmourners: "I loved Pat and I looked up
OL,16,Fto him and I will miss him as we all
OL,17,Fwill."
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
