OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPM pays tribute to 'political
OL,4,Agenius' Pat Karney at funeral
OL,5,
OL,6,FKarney, who represented Harpurhey in
OL,7,Fnorth Manchester from 1979, died on 13
OL,8,FOctober aged 78. He was known for
OL,9,Fchampioning the city's major
OL,10,Fcelebrations and played a significant
OL,11,Frole in its political life.
OL,13,FBefore the service, his hearse paused
OL,14,Fin Albert Square, where a Ferris wheel
OL,15,Fdisplayed the message "Thank You Pat"
OL,16,Fbeside the city's Christmas Markets.
